{"id": "NC-Q3R1-07-SLEEP-AS-EXIT-PROOF", "category": "q3r1-7", "what": "a sleep stands in for the helper's exit report", "files": ["crates/nexus-verifier-sandbox/tests/support/never_populated.rs"], "target": "phase2_never_populated", "test": "controls::np_09_a_late_exit_is_waited_for_by_its_own_report", "marker": "the exit was not waited for by its report", "test_passes_unmutated": true, "compiled": true, "failed_intended_test": true, "marker_in_assertion": true, "files_restored": true, "exit": 101, "ok": true, "assertion": "the exit was not waited for by its report: a scope was proven for an unmovable process: \"placed before the helper's exit was reported\" [unit None; placement error None; boundary retained false; retries 0; elapsed Some(0ns); cleanup confirmed false; loaded scopes Some(Ok({})); boundary None]"}
